            "review_title": "Review at Ms Hương Ly Vietnamese Restaurant & Cafe",
            "review_text": "JLog\n9 contributions\n0\nGreat service, delicious food, peaceful location and the bonus of a train coming past!\nOct 2024 • Family\nAfter experiencing the noise and chaos of the other end of Train Street, this peaceful location was a lovely surprise. The owners were very friendly and attentive whilst not hovering. The outlook to streets beyond were lovely and the food was delicious.\n\nI'll definitely come back here if I return to Hanoi.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 8, 2024",
